{"text": "Clues.\n\nLina has a notebook. She writes in it.\n\nOne: a light at nine o'clock.\n\nTwo: earth on the steps.\n\nShe looks at the steps again. There is more earth. It goes down to floor three. Then it goes down to floor two. It stops at a green door.\n\nIt is the door of Mrs Ada.\n\nMrs Ada opens the door. Her flat smells of tomatoes.\n\n\"Good morning, Lina,\" she says.\n\nLina looks at her hands. They are green!\n\n\"Your flower is very dry,\" says Mrs Ada. \"The flower in the red pot.\"\n\nLina is surprised. Her flower is on floor four. How does Mrs Ada know?\n\n\"Mrs Ada, who lives behind the blue door?\" asks Lina.\n\nMrs Ada smiles again. \"No one, dear. And I go to bed early. I sleep at eight.\"\n\nShe closes her door. Lina sits on the steps. She opens her notebook.\n\nThree: green hands.\n\nFour: a smell of tomatoes.\n\nFive: \"I sleep at eight.\"\n\nLina thinks. Then she writes a question. Is it true?\n\nThat night, Lina does not sleep. She sits behind her door and listens.\n\nAt eight o'clock, the building is quiet. At half past eight, it is quiet, too.\n\nAt nine, Lina hears someone on the steps. Someone slow. They go up, up, up.\n\nThen Lina hears a key.\n\nThe blue door opens.", "textSha256": "cc0b4809cd518ed5142589f6618f3e2011c52b7f296030c0cf55379a23518e4f", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["C", "l", "u", "e", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "L", "i", "n", "a", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "n", "o", "t", "e", "b", "o", "o", "k", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "w", "r", "i", "t", "e", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "i", "t", ".", "\n", "\n", "O", "n", "e", ":", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", " ", "o", "'", "c", "l", "o", "c", "k", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "w", "o", ":", " ", "e", "a", "r", "t", "h", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "o",